        <h1>Orion Crew Performance and Safety Immediately Follwoing Postflight Water Landings: Emergency Egress (Decond_Crew_Perf)</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: Decond_Crew_Perf</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="action-banner">
          <div class="action-banner-text">
            <strong>Official Source:</strong> National Aeronautics and Space Administration Life Sciences Data Archive
          </div>
          <a href="https://nlsp.nasa.gov/search/data/details/899d4d21-ad8b-5f8f-97da-1200d54d7297?dataType=EXPERIMENTS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">
